    "sections": {
        "description": "Spa Parlor is a clean and structured theme designed for wellness and beauty service websites. It is suitable for spa centers, massage therapists, beauty salons, wellness clinics, skincare studios, and health professionals who want a simple way to present their services online. The theme focuses on clear layouts that highlight services, pricing, treatment details, staff information, and contact sections so visitors can easily explore the site.With responsive design, customizable sections, service listing layouts, testimonial areas, and blog support, Spa Parlor helps businesses share updates, skincare tips, and wellness articles while keeping the website organized. It also supports service pages, appointment information sections, image galleries, and contact forms,making it easier for visitors to understand available treatments.This theme can be useful for spa owners, salon managers, massage centers, beauty professionals, and wellness consultants who need a professional website to showcase services, treatments, and business information online."
    },
